WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.144
Priya: Okay. Plan. Two windows — Thursday and Friday.
好。计划：两个窗口，周四和周五。

2
00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:12.865
Sam: One node at a time. Cordon and drain it, upgrade, then uncordon.
一次一台。先标记不可调度并驱逐，升级，再恢复调度。

3
00:00:12.865 --> 00:00:17.521
Priya: Right. And wait ten minutes between nodes.
对。节点之间等十分钟。

4
00:00:17.521 --> 00:00:23.546
Sam: That's the slow part. The rollout is stuck if any pod won't move.
这就是慢的地方。只要有 Pod 迁不走，发布就卡住。

5
00:00:23.546 --> 00:00:27.842
Priya: Exactly. That's the signal to stop.
正是。那就是该停的信号。

6
00:00:27.842 --> 00:00:29.258
Alex: Do you want me in the channel?
要我待在频道里吗？

7
00:00:29.258 --> 00:00:37.491
Priya: Yes. App teams on standby. Just to recap the freeze — no deploys Thursday.
要。应用团队待命。再小结一下冻结窗口——周四不发布。

8
00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:39.819
Alex: Understood. I'll tell the teams.
明白。我去跟各团队说。

9
00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:44.715
Sam: And I am having bandwidth Friday morning for the second window.
我周五上午有精力跟第二个窗口。

10
00:00:44.715 --> 00:00:48.508
Priya: Good. That's the plan then.
好。那就这么定。

11
00:00:48.508 --> 00:00:53.164
Priya: Sorry, one more — the drain timeout needs a bump.
抱歉，还有一件——drain 的超时要调大。

12
00:00:53.164 --> 00:00:55.420
Sam: Already in the chart.
已经写进 chart 里了。

